  - m_Id: 1245333434368
    m_Localized: 'Defense +{0}

      Decreases by 1 on attack damage taken

      When
      it reaches 0, gain {1} Attack at the start of next enemy turn and use Tidal
      Wave'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1251008327680
    m_Localized: 'If any Flip survives at the end of the enemy turn, +1

      At
      {0}, remove all Flip at the start of enemy turn

      Deal {1} damage to all
      allies and reset the stack

      If below {0} at the end of enemy turn,

      summon
      a Flip'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1257656299520
    m_Localized: 'Decreases by the attack damage taken

      When it reaches 0,
      spit out the swallowed target

      If any stacks remain at the end of the
      player''s turn

      Deal {0} damage to the target, recover {1} HP,

      then
      spit out the target'
